# Everything here is repo material that no build step reads. Keeping it out of
# the upload makes deploys smaller and, more usefully, means the design files
# and the SQL are not sitting on a web host.

# 33 design HTML files. Source of truth for the UI, read by humans, never
# imported by the app.
design_elements/

# Migrations, seeds and the pgTAP suite. Applied with the Supabase CLI from a
# developer machine or CI, never from a Vercel build.
supabase/

# Specs, architecture notes, the handoff.
docs/

# Agent and editor config.
.claude/
AGENTS.md

.github/
